`Use case: ads-marketing. Asset type: final still frame for a 9:16 image-to-video B-roll clip. Create the first reference image for a Chinese news explainer about ticketing platforms and refunds. A premium editorial halftone paper collage: a recognizable ticketing platform represented by a paper-cut building with a clear central ticket entrance and a small Chinese sign “票务平台”. Warm burnt-orange flat paper background filling the entire vertical frame, black-and-white halftone building, cream cardstock edges, selective teal and red paper accents, tactile paper grain and soft shadows. Composition: the building and entrance occupy the middle core, with secondary paper fragments and halftone texture near the edges; the top area may contain only secondary decoration for a news headline overlay. Keep the main object away from the extreme top. Crisp cut edges, 2D stop-motion collage. Chinese text must be legible and exactly “票务平台”. No other text, no English, no logo, no watermark, no UI, no subtitles, no photorealistic environment, no 3D.`,
`Use case: ads-marketing. Asset type: final still frame for a 9:16 image-to-video B-roll clip. Create the second reference image for the same Chinese news explainer. A large cream paper ticket is the central object, with bold, perfectly legible Chinese characters “特殊商品” printed on the ticket. Premium editorial halftone paper collage, black-and-white halftone ticket texture with red and teal cardstock accents, warm mustard-yellow paper field filling the frame, crisp cream keyline, soft paper shadow. The ticket sits in the middle core, large and easy to recognize; edges contain only secondary paper scraps and halftone dots, and the top region remains safe for a large news headline with no essential information there. Exact Chinese text only: “特殊商品”. No extra text, no English, no logo, no watermark, no UI, no subtitles, no 3D, no photorealistic scene.`,
`Use case: ads-marketing. Asset type: final still frame for a 9:16 image-to-video B-roll clip. Create the third reference image for the same Chinese news explainer: the cream ticket labeled exactly “特殊商品” is being pushed into the central refund entrance of the paper-cut ticketing platform, making the visual relationship obvious. Show a simplified paper hand or paper force pushing the ticket inward, with the ticket platform building behind it. Premium editorial halftone paper collage, burnt-orange flat paper field, black-and-white halftone platform and hand, red and teal cardstock accents, cream keylines, tactile paper grain, soft shadows. Main action is large and centered in the middle core; the full frame is filled with secondary paper texture and small scraps, while the top remains safe for a headline and contains no essential text. Preserve the exact Chinese label “特殊商品”; no other text, no English, no logo, no watermark, no UI, no subtitles, no photorealistic environment, no 3D.`,
`Use case: ads-marketing. Asset type: final still frame for a 9:16 image-to-video B-roll clip. Create the fourth and final reference image for the same Chinese news explainer. The paper ticketing platform remains in the middle core, but a red paper barrier with a bold red X has been pushed away from the refund entrance; a bright teal refund arrow is now open and points outward. The ticket labeled exactly “特殊商品” remains visible beside the entrance. Premium editorial halftone paper collage, warm coral-orange paper field filling the frame, black-and-white halftone building, cream cardstock edges, red X barrier, teal arrow, tactile paper grain and soft shadows. The result must be immediately readable in the middle core; edges may contain secondary collage scraps, and the top area is safe for a news headline with no essential information. Exact Chinese text only: “特殊商品”. No extra text, no English, no logo, no watermark, no UI, no subtitles, no 3D.`
];
